PXLogic Sigrok Analyzer Sidecar

This sidecar is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or
later (GPL-2.0-or-later). It links PXView's libsigrokdecode fork and loads its
native C protocol decoder modules. See the PXView source tree and individual
decoder source headers for copyright and license details.

The sidecar is a separate executable and is not linked into the PXLogic Tauri
process. No GPL source or object code is linked into the MIT/Apache Rust
workspace libraries.

The full GPL-2.0 text is available at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt

